# Whitelist mode: ignore everything except the paths below.
/*

# Allowed top-level directories
!/.github/
!/addons/
!/benchmarks/
!/benchmarks/**
!/samples/
!/tests/

# Benchmark raw outputs (keep report SVGs / markdown)
/benchmarks/artifacts/

# Allowed top-level files
!/.editorconfig
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/DotPudicaFramework.csproj
!/DotPudicaFramework.sln
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/README_CN.md
!/VERSION
!/project.godot

# Ignore build/editor noise inside allowed trees
**/.godot/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/android/
**/export/
**/build/

# IDE and local workspace files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# OS-generated files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
**/._*
